{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-la-tilia","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"la-tilia-dubai-properties-villanova","about":"La Tilia at Villanova by Dubai Properties is the newest phase in the heart of Dubailand, offering a perfect blend of modern living and natural serenity. This gated community is designed for families, featuring 3 and 4 bedroom townhouses that balance contemporary architecture with lush green surroundings. Spacious interiors, expansive balconies, and floor-to-ceiling windows create seamless indoor-outdoor living spaces, encouraging a connection with nature.  The community is thoughtfully crafted to enrich daily life, with amenities such as a central park, cycling and jogging tracks, a beach pool, and fitness zones. Families can enjoy kids’ play areas, sports courts, and gathering spaces, fostering an active and vibrant lifestyle. Strategically located near Emirates Road and major highways, La Tilia ensures easy access to key destinations like Downtown Dubai and Global Village. It’s a harmonious blend of convenience, tranquility, and connectivity, offering an exceptional standard of family living.","price":2690000,"title":"La Tilia","bitrix":{"id":1042,"pf_id":"are.2.14770","source":null,"project_id":"La Tilia","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"La Tilia","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Dubai Properties","project_location":"Dubai Land"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/la_tilia_feat_758d13321c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/la_tilia_feat_758d13321c.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0700831,"lng":55.3415381},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/la_10_be8b2c49a2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/la_10_be8b2c49a2.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/la_9_